# openWallet-spec code owners.
#
# The floor is narrow on purpose, as openXwallet's is: the gate that decides
# whether a delta in this leg is valid, the pin that decides WHICH OpenSpec CLI
# that gate runs, the artifact the pin names, and the workflows that decide
# whether the gate runs at all. A pull request that could change what runs
# cannot clear itself.

# The pinned CLI's verifier and installer, vendored byte-identical from
# openxFactory. An edit here forks the estate's one pin verifier.
/scripts/validate-openspec-cli-pin.py   @brettheap
/scripts/install-pinned-openspec-cli.py   @brettheap

# WHICH OpenSpec CLI, at WHICH digest, the gate must install.
/contracts/   @brettheap

# The pinned artifact itself. Its file name carries the pin's SHA-1.
/tools/openspec-cli-pin/   @brettheap

# Whether the gate runs, in what order, and under which status-check token.
/.github/workflows/   @brettheap
